      "title": "The Mythology Of Conscious AI",
      "gist": "Conscious AI is unlikely because brains differ too deeply from computers, so we must guard against false beliefs about machine minds.",
      "question": "Could AI ever truly be conscious, and why does that question matter? (an argument against)"
