      ],
      "title": "Cultural History Of Synthetic Minds",
      "gist": "Centuries of fiction, from the Golem to HAL 9000, imagine artificial beings with minds, and these stories warn that creating real synthetic consciousness rarely ends well for the humans involved."
    },
