        "spya-d3g67c",
        "spya-cv97j7"
      ],
      "title": "Computational Functionalism Assumption",
      "gist": "Conscious AI depends on computational functionalism, the assumption that running the right computation suffices for consciousness, an assumption the author argues is likely false and will test with four arguments."
    },
