      "title": "Summing Up The Case",
      "gist": "Cognitive biases, deep brain-computer differences, life's possible necessity, and the simulation-instantiation gap together suggest consciousness is unlikely to simply emerge from smarter AI, though it is not strictly ruled out."
    },
