        "n0139",
        "n0140",
        "n0141"
      ],
      "range": [
        "spya-e7fdmb",
        "spya-yverz7"
      ],
      "title": "The Ethics Of Uncertainty",
      "gist": "Because whether AI is conscious affects its moral standing, and no theory can certainly rule machine consciousness in or out, deliberately trying to create conscious AI would be reckless and ethically dangerous."
    },
