      "title": "Where Consciousness Might Emerge",
      "gist": "Alternative technologies like neuromorphic computing or synthetic biology, especially brain-like organoids grown from stem cells, may risk accidental consciousness more than large language models do, and conscious-seeming AI is already a present concern."
