        "spya-xk9gne",
        "spya-d89xf7"
      ],
      "title": "Living With Conscious-Seeming AI",
      "gist": "Like a visual illusion, the feeling that an AI is conscious persists even when we know otherwise, and with no decisive test for consciousness, we must weigh wrongly granting AI rights against wrongly denying them."
    },
