        "n0162",
        "n0163"
      ],
      "range": [
        "spya-v98v5u",
        "spya-zv36xq"
      ],
      "title": "AI As A Mirror",
      "gist": "AI is reshaping society regardless of consciousness, and treating it as a mirror of ourselves, conflating algorithms with biological minds, risks overestimating machines while underestimating our own human nature."
    },
